-- City-path fix (2026-11-16): 39 batch 2 listings in Pensacola FL, Harrisburg PA,
-- Albany NY and High Point NC were loaded into D1 with the intake city value
-- 'City, ST' in listings.city and the state suffix in listings.city_slug
-- (e.g. city='Pensacola, FL', city_slug='pensacola-fl'). The renderer builds
-- breadcrumb, category-hub and town links from city_slug and the city label
-- from city, so those pages linked to /florida/pensacola-fl/ (404) and read
-- 'Pensacola, FL, FL'. The listing slugs/paths themselves are correct and do
-- not change. This file corrects city, city_slug and the harvested text
-- fields (page_title, og_title, meta_desc, address) that carry the same
-- doubled-state strings. Companion files fix towns/category_towns (02) and
-- bump dataset_version (03). Provenance: citypath-fix-2026-11-16 in updated_at.

